---
/** UX Hub: Sell Connectivity From Your Shopify Store */
import angelWatch from '../../../assets/home/customers/angel-watch.webp?url';
---

<section class="sec sec--white" id="shopify">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shp-head rv">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Shopify Integration</p>
        <h2 class="h2">Sell Connectivity From Your <em class="s">Shopify Store</em></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede">Offer mobile plans, eSIMs, and devices through Shopify while Spenza handles activation, subscriptions, and billing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="shp">
      <div class="shp-steps rv">
        <div class="shp-step"><span>01</span><div><h3>Publish plans and devices</h3><p>List eSIM plans and devices on your Shopify store with your own pricing and markups.</p></div></div>
        <div class="shp-step"><span>02</span><div><h3>Validate at checkout</h3><p>IMEI validation on the product page makes sure customers only buy plans that work with their device.</p></div></div>
        <div class="shp-step"><span>03</span><div><h3>Seamless Activation</h3><p>Spenza automatically creates subscriptions, provisions eSIMs, and tracks device assignments after checkout.</p></div></div>
        <div class="shp-step"><span>04</span><div><h3>Stay in sync</h3><p>Keep plans, orders, and payments synced across regions and currencies, with every line visible in Spenza.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel rv" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="panel-h"><span>your-store.com / products / smartwatch</span><span class="chip-s">Shopify</span></div>
        <div class="shp-viz">
          <div class="store">
            <div class="store-img"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><rect x="38" y="6" width="24" height="22" rx="4" fill="#d9cfc2"/><rect x="38" y="72" width="24" height="22" rx="4" fill="#d9cfc2"/><rect x="24" y="22" width="52" height="56" rx="14" fill="#0f1420"/><rect x="30" y="28" width="40" height="44" rx="9" fill="#ff4904"/><circle cx="50" cy="46" r="9" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M50 46 L50 40 M50 46 L55 49" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="40" y="60" width="20" height="4" rx="2" fill="#ffffffb3"/><rect x="76" y="44" width="4" height="10" rx="2" fill="#0f1420"/></svg></div>
            <div class="store-b">
              <small>Your brand</small>
              <b>Kids Smartwatch + Plan</b>
              <span class="pr">$149 device &middot; plan billed monthly</span>
              <div class="var">
                <div class="on"><span>Basic &middot; 500 MB</span><em>$6/mo</em></div>
                <div><span>Plus &middot; 2 GB + voice</span><em>$10/mo</em></div>
              </div>
              <div class="imei"><span>IMEI 35 2094 &hellip; 4471</span><i>&#10003; compatible</i></div>
              <div class="atc">Add to cart</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="ful">
            <div class="ful-h"><span>Spenza &middot; order #1042</span></div>
            <div class="ful-s"><i>&#10003;</i><span>Order received from Shopify<em>payment captured</em></span></div>
            <div class="ful-s"><i>&#10003;</i><span>Subscription created<em>Basic &middot; 500 MB &middot; monthly</em></span></div>
            <div class="ful-s"><i>&#10003;</i><span>eSIM provisioned<em>device assigned &middot; 4 s</em></span></div>
            <div class="ful-s run"><i>&#8635;</i><span>Branded activation email<em>sending</em></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="proof rv">
      <div><small>Case study</small><img class="proof-logo" src={angelWatch} alt="Angel Watch" width="105" height="36" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div>
        <p>Read How Angel Watch Increased Subscription Revenue with Spenza</p>
        <ul><li>Shopify checkout with device and plan together</li><li>Branded activation flow</li><li>Lower cost per line</li></ul>
      </div>
      <a href="/telecom/angel-watch-iot-business-casestudy/">The Angel Watch Story &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
